{
  "text": "```systemverilog\nmodule edge_propagator (\n  input  logic clk_tx_i,\n  input  logic rstn_tx_i,\n  input  logic edge_i,\n  input  logic clk_rx_i,\n  input  logic rstn_rx_i,\n  output logic edge_o\n);\n\n  // TX domain: detect rising edge of edge_i and generate a toggle\n  logic edge_i_d;\n  logic edge_detected;\n  logic toggle_tx;\n\n  always_ff @(posedge clk_tx_i or negedge rstn_tx_i) begin\n    if (!rstn_tx_i) begin\n      edge_i_d    <= 1'b0;\n      toggle_tx   <= 1'b0;\n    end else begin\n      edge_i_d    <= edge_i;\n      edge_detected <= edge_i & ~edge_i_d;\n      if (edge_i & ~edge_i_d)\n        toggle_tx <= ~toggle_tx;\n    end\n  end\n\n  // Synchronize toggle_tx into RX domain\n  logic toggle_rx_1;\n  logic toggle_rx_2;\n\n  always_ff @(posedge clk_rx_i or negedge rstn_rx_i) begin\n    if (!rstn_rx_i) begin\n      toggle_rx_1 <= 1'b0;\n      toggle_rx_2 <= 1'b0;\n    end else begin\n      toggle_rx_1 <= toggle_tx;\n      toggle_rx_2 <= toggle_rx_1;\n    end\n  end\n\n  // RX domain: detect toggle change and generate a single-cycle pulse\n  logic toggle_rx_2_d;\n  logic toggle_changed;\n\n  always_ff @(posedge clk_rx_i or negedge rstn_rx_i) begin\n    if (!rstn_rx_i) begin\n      toggle_rx_2_d <= 1'b0;\n    end else begin\n      toggle_rx_2_d <= toggle_rx_2;\n    end\n  end\n\n  assign toggle_changed = toggle_rx_2 ^ toggle_rx_2_d;\n  assign edge_o = toggle_changed;\n\nendmodule\n```<|im_end|>",
